# Auto-generated photo cache for real (OpenStreetMap-imported) restaurants --
# see src/lib/restaurantPhotos.js -- and dish photos (scripts/fetch-dish-photos.mjs).
# These used to be gitignored on the assumption that each environment would
# regenerate its own from OpenStreetMap/Openverse, but production never ran
# that pipeline, so photo_url in the (shared) database pointed at files that
# only ever existed on whichever dev machine fetched them. Committed instead
# now so a deploy actually carries them -- see PUBLIC_ASSET_BASE_URL's
# comment in .env.example and scripts/fix-photo-urls.mjs.
